Tech stack: pnpm 10.30.0, @mendix/pluggable-widgets-tools 11.8.1, React 18.2, MobX 6.16, antd 6.4.3, dhtmlx-gantt ^9.1.4, SCSS

Current focus: Gantt refactor — Simplified Architecture. Key changes:
1. Bỏ `onEvent` + `eventType` + `eventPayload` → dùng `onClicked`, `onDoubleClicked`, `onChanged`, `onAdded`, `onDropped` với write-back `outItemId`, `outType`, `outChangedNum`
2. Event bus đơn giản: GlobalKey `AX_EVENT_BUS`, API emit/on/removeListener
3. Chỉ `AxGanttStore`; main gồm `AxGanttChartView` + `AxGanttInner`
4. Unscheduled groups: `show_unscheduled=false`, groups không cần start/end date
5. Mock data từ `gantt-test.json`; types: DISTRICT_GROUP, CUSTOM_GROUP, TASK, SUB_TASK
6. Phase 2 via /speckit-tasks + /speckit-implement
